s a gear that pulls the steps up."},{"role":"problem3","text":"But if the motor fails, the loaded steps roll back down."},{"role":"fix3","text":"So you add a brake that stops them when the power fails."},{"role":"finish","text":"Add a handrail and a ceiling light to complete it."},{"role":"congrats","text":"Congratulations, you have built an escalator."}]}